// The thread kind's step when the watcher was unsure, until 16 Nov (thread.kind; paper-research m1249): the owner
// picked one of TICKETS, or a new thread. No kind asks it now: an unsure intake is a thread of its own (the owner on
// N-354/N-355, paper-research N-101.p1285). It stays defined because the record's history is fixed: every thread that
// ran the kind with this step keeps its recorded program, and that program must still check against today's calls
// (paper-research N-101.p1308, after c0be05b removed it and prod's research record no longer replayed).
call pick(text: Text, tickets: [Ticket]) -> Place(ticket: Ticket) | Thread
  task pick
  template
    Your message could go on more than one ticket. Which one, or a new thread?
    {{ for t in tickets }}
    - {{ t }}
    {{ end }}
    <<<
    {{ text }}
    >>>
